  hint: Found outside the cafe
  characterDescription: "Crow\r\nFound outside the cafe\r\nOutfit inspired by the
    medieval era\r\n\r\nIf you\u2019ve ever had shiny things go missing mysteriously,
    or thought you heard someone call your name while visiting the Avebury site it
    may have been Cas the crow. The only thing they love more than pranks is food,
    and they can frequently be heard laughing VERY loudly.\r\n"
